Package: kuhlerprofil
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Katon <katonadams.f@gmail.com>
Depends: dbus, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/katon26/kuhler-profil
Description: ASUS Linux thermal profile governor, fan curves, and battery health guardian
 KühlerProfil is a native Linux background daemon, CLI, and GNOME Shell
 extension for ASUS VivoBook, ZenBook, TUF, and ROG laptops.
 Features:
  * ASUS ACPI thermal profile control (Silent, Standard, Boost)
  * Multi-point RPM fan curve programming and intelligent auto-governor
  * Zero-RPM cooldown recovery governor (Instant Reset / Cooldown Decay)
  * Battery health charging limiter (60%, 80%, 100%)
  * Interactive TUI dashboard and GNOME Shell Quick Settings menu
